Line 1: This "(" is never closed.
    say (1 plus 2
        ^
Add a ")" where the group ends, on the same line.

Line 2: There's a ")" here without a matching "(".
    say 1 plus 2)
                ^
Remove it, or add a "(" where the group starts.

Line 3: Something is missing after "(".
    say ()
        ^
Add a value there, like a number, some text in quotes, or a name.

Line 4: This "(" is never closed.
    say ((x)
        ^
Add a ")" where the group ends, on the same line.
